SUMMARY:Empress's Sacred Marriage Ritual Healing Temple
DESCRIPTION:Awakening Asheville\nEmpress University invites you to The Emp
 ress's Divine Marriage Initiation. This Archetype Of The Empowered Feminin
 e is connected to the mysteries of merging\, conception\, and resurrection
 . The Empress Archetype is related to Lakshmi\, Hathor and Aphrodite Pande
 mos\, the earthly Aphrodite\, as well as love\, beauty\, sexuality\, joy\,
  ecstasy\, relaxation\, nature\, and abundance. Through her ritual of sacr
 ed union she also represents commitment\, tenacity\, grit and determinatio
 n.\n\nThis time of year\, spring and Taurus season\, is associated with Be
 ltane\, Persephone's return from the underworld and celebration. This astr
 ological season is about pleasure\, sensuality and embodiment as a path of
  awakening and spiritual growth. This is a great time of year to set inten
 tions for the growing season and make a powerful commitment and vow to you
 rself and your dreams. If you have never committed to yourself or your spi
 ritual Divine Feminine path now is the time. Empress University invites yo
 u to participate in the inner alchemical marriage of Hieros Gamos.\n\nWe w
 ill gather in a small group on private land in a natural built temple home
  to learn about the Empress Archetype's Sacred Marriage initiation in rela
 tion to the feminine life cycle and psyche. We'll discuss active receptivi
 ty and how the feminine attracts support\, wealth and prosperity. You will
  learn about Attachment Science\, Attachment Styles and how we bond throug
 h love and sexuality from a depth perspective.\nWe'll have a chance to sha
 re about our experience with commitment\, creation\, completion and even o
 ur Attachment Style.\n\nPlease bring a symbol of commitment and you will h
 ave an opportunity to create your own Sacred Marriage vows to yourself\, y
 our higher self\, Goddess\, God and whatever you would like to make a sacr
 ed commitment to in a powerful ritual container.\nThe sliding scale donati
 on for this event is 33-99$ Please contact Amber at 704-246-9420 to RSVP a
 nd have a brief conversation before receiving the private location of the 
 event. You will be given material to prepare for this ritual initiation vi
 a written material and video.\n\nThis Healing Ritual Temple will be follow
 ed by an Empress And Sacred Marriage Embodiment Tantric Dance Temple the f
 ollowing saturday on May 16th at 6pm on the new moon in Taurus only for th
 ose who have attended this event.\n\nEach month Empress University present
 s another aspect of the Divine Feminine along with the astrological season
  and offers healing and embodiment temples for people who are called to wo
 rk with the goddess in her many forms. EU is a year and a day Priestess Sc
 hool and Coaching Certification for those who feel called to actualize the
 ir potential so that they can impact the world in a bigger way and make a 
 difference in the larger world. Empress University currently includes A Ma
 gdalen Based Sexual Priestess And Love Coach Training that will be a separ
 ate course in the future.\n\nAmber St. Germain is a therapist\, MFT and li
 fe and love coach who specializes in Attachment\, trauma\, Sex Therapy and
  tantra. She has had a successful practice as a spiritual entrepreneur and
  healer for over 20 years and has created and run multiple 5 and 6 figure 
 businesses. She loves to empower others in the realms of relationships\, s
 exuality\, health and business. Learn More at EmpressUniversity.Coach and 
 [[DeepPlayTherapy.com.](http://deepplaytherapy.com./)]([http://deepplaythe
 rapy.com./](http://deepplaytherapy.com./))
